{"seq":1,"slug":"pricing-stages","title":"商品价→活动→券→实付的阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/pricing-pipeline/pricing-stages","wordCount":1604,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品价-活动-券-实付的阶段\">商品价→活动→券→实付的阶段</h1><p>用户在详情页看到&quot;¥199 到手价&quot;，从商品原价到这个数字之间有一个确定的、可重放的<strong>计算流水线</strong>：定价、活动价、优惠券、支付优惠、运费，每一段都改变金额，每一段都必须留下可核对的痕迹。把这条流水线实现成一串互相独立、顺序固定的阶段（stage），是算价系统最重要的结构决策——它决定了线上算价、试算页、退款分摊、财务对账能不能共用同一份逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流水线的输入是一个购物车加一份上下文，输出是一个 <code>PriceBreakdown</code>。每一阶段接收上一阶段的输出，做一件事，再把结果交给下一阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[CartLine: sku × qty] --&gt; B[1. 定价 stage]&#10;  B --&gt;|列表价 listPrice| C[2. 活动价 stage]&#10;  C --&gt;|活动价 salePrice| D[3. 促销 stage: 满减/折扣]&#10;  D --&gt;|促销后 subtotal| E[4. 券 stage]&#10;  E --&gt;|券后 payable| F[5. 运费 stage]&#10;  F --&gt; G[6. 支付优惠 stage]&#10;  G --&gt; H[PriceBreakdown: 实付 + 分摊明细]&#10;  B -.-&gt;|记录每一步| L[(定价快照/审计)]&#10;  C -.-&gt; L&#10;  D -.-&gt; L&#10;  E -.-&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[CartLine: sku × qty] --&gt; B[1. 定价 stage]\n  B --&gt;|列表价 listPrice| C[2. 活动价 stage]\n  C --&gt;|活动价 salePrice| D[3. 促销 stage: 满减/折扣]\n  D --&gt;|促销后 subtotal| E[4. 券 stage]\n  E --&gt;|券后 payable| F[5. 运费 stage]\n  F --&gt; G[6. 支付优惠 stage]\n  G --&gt; H[PriceBreakdown: 实付 + 分摊明细]\n  B -.-&gt;|记录每一步| L[(定价快照/审计)]\n  C -.-&gt; L\n  D -.-&gt; L\n  E -.-&gt; L</pre><p>六个阶段的职责边界必须清晰，判定标准是&quot;<strong>金额变化的归因</strong>&quot;：列表价来自商品主数据，活动价来自单品级定价活动，促销 stage 处理订单级满减与折扣，券 stage 处理用户持有的券，运费独立，支付优惠来自支付渠道。同一笔金额变化只能归属一个阶段，否则财务对账时会出现&quot;这笔减免是谁带来的&quot;说不清的情况。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>归因对象</th>\n<th>是否持久化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>skuId, 渠道</td>\n<td><code>listPrice</code></td>\n<td>商品主数据</td>\n<td>快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动价</td>\n<td><code>listPrice</code> + 单品活动</td>\n<td><code>salePrice</code></td>\n<td>单品级促销</td>\n<td>快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销</td>\n<td><code>salePrice</code> × qty</td>\n<td><code>promoDeduction</code></td>\n<td>订单级促销</td>\n<td>快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券</td>\n<td>券后金额 + 券实例</td>\n<td><code>couponDeduction</code></td>\n<td>券实例</td>\n<td>快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费</td>\n<td>地址/重量/活动</td>\n<td><code>shippingFee</code></td>\n<td>履约</td>\n<td>快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付优惠</td>\n<td>支付渠道</td>\n<td><code>payDeduction</code></td>\n<td>渠道</td>\n<td>快照</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"阶段契约-统一签名与可组合\">阶段契约：统一签名与可组合</h2><p>要让流水线可测试、可重放、可单阶段替换，每个 stage 必须遵守同一份契约：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StageContext {&#10;  now: Date; // 注入时钟，不读系统时间&#10;  version: string; // 规则快照版本，全链路一致&#10;  channel: string;&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  tags: Set&lt;string&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface StageResult&lt;S&gt; {&#10;  state: S; // 传给下一阶段&#10;  deductions: DeductionRecord[]; // 本阶段产生的减免记录（带归因）&#10;  notes: string[]; // 判定轨迹，供排查&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Stage&lt;S&gt; = (state: S, ctx: StageContext) =&gt; StageResult&lt;S&gt;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StageContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注入时钟，不读系统时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 规则快照版本，全链路一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StageResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 传给下一阶段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deductions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeductionRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 本阶段产生的减免记录（带归因）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  notes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 判定轨迹，供排查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StageContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StageResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条硬约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>纯函数 + 注入上下文</strong>：stage 内不读时钟、不查数据库、不做 RPC。所有外部输入由 <code>StageContext</code> 与上一阶段的 <code>state</code> 携带。这让同一份流水线能跑在三个地方——线上算价、H5 试算器、T+1 对账重算——并保证三者结果一致。</li>\n<li><strong>返回结构而非标量</strong>：每阶段除了新的 <code>state</code>，还要返回 <code>deductions</code>（谁减了多少、摊到哪行）和 <code>notes</code>（为什么这样减）。后者是排查&quot;为什么我的券没生效&quot;的唯一依据。</li>\n<li><strong>失败即整体失败</strong>：某个 stage 抛错时，整条流水线失败并回滚，而不是&quot;跳过这一阶段继续&quot;。一个&quot;券算错了但订单照样能下&quot;的系统，比&quot;算价失败让用户重试&quot;危险得多。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function runPipeline(stages: Stage&lt;any&gt;[], initial: any, ctx: StageContext) {&#10;  let state = initial;&#10;  const deductions: DeductionRecord[] = [];&#10;  const notes: string[] = [];&#10;  for (const stage of stages) {&#10;    const r = stage(state, ctx);&#10;    state = r.state;&#10;    deductions.push(...r.deductions);&#10;    notes.push(...r.notes);&#10;  }&#10;  state.breakdown = buildBreakdown(state, deductions);&#10;  state.trace = notes;&#10;  return state;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StageContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> initial;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deductions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeductionRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> notes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stages) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state, ctx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    deductions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r.deductions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    notes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r.notes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  state.breakdown </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildBreakdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state, deductions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  state.trace </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>version</code> 字段是这条流水线的&quot;时间戳之外的第二把锁&quot;：它标识本次计算用的是哪一版规则快照。用户下单时把 <code>version</code> 一起落库，退款重算时用同一个 <code>version</code> 重放，结果必然一致——这是<a href=\"idempotent-pricing\">算价幂等与下单价一致</a>的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行级分摊-一条减免怎么落到商品上\">行级分摊：一条减免怎么落到商品上</h2><p>流水线里每一笔减免都是订单级的，但退款需要行级的。所以每一阶段在计算减免时，必须同时算出<strong>分摊</strong>。分摊方法有三种，选错会在退款时产生纠纷：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>按行小计比例</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i = d \\cdot \\frac{s_i}{\\sum s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2315em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>订单级满减、券</td>\n<td>小额尾差需处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>按数量均摊</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i = d / n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>同价商品</td>\n<td>异价时不合理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>指定归属</strong></td>\n<td>由 <code>allocations</code> 显式给出</td>\n<td>单品级活动</td>\n<td>需 <code>benefit</code> 返回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>比例分摊的尾差处理有一条标准做法——<strong>最大余额法</strong>（largest remainder）：先按比例取整到分，把因取整而少分的余数按小数部分从大到小依次补一分，直到分完。这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum a_i = d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 严格成立，不会出现&quot;分摊合计比减免少一分&quot;的对账差异。这个方法在比例代表制席位分配里就是 Hamilton 法：先给每个主体分配其整数份额，再把剩余名额按小数余数从大到小逐个补上（来源：Largest remainder method, Wikipedia，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Largest_remainder_method\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Largest_remainder_method</a> ）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function allocateByRatio(total: Money, lines: CartLine[]): Money[] {&#10;  const sum = lines.reduce((s, l) =&gt; s + l.amount, 0);&#10;  const raw = lines.map((l) =&gt; (total * l.amount) / sum);&#10;  const base = raw.map((x) =&gt; Math.floor(x));&#10;  let rest = total - base.reduce((s, x) =&gt; s + x, 0);&#10;  const order = raw.map((x, i) =&gt; ({ i, frac: x - Math.floor(x) })).sort((a, b) =&gt; b.frac - a.frac);&#10;  for (const { i } of order) {&#10;    if (rest &lt;= 0) break;&#10;    base[i] += 1;&#10;    rest -= 1;&#10;  }&#10;  return base;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> allocateByRatio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CartLine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lines.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span>